Raspberry Pi Gemini Voice Assistant

Project adaptation and implementation: Pradip Sapkota

This repository is based on the open-source "Google Gemini Voice Chatbot on Raspberry Pi" project by TechMakerAI.
The upstream code was distributed under the MIT License. The original copyright notice and license text are preserved in LICENSE as required by that license.

This adaptation reorganizes and documents the project for portfolio use, including clearer configuration, environment-variable API key handling, improved error reporting, local wiring documentation, dependency metadata, Git ignore rules, and project-specific README documentation.

The Raspberry Pi wiring image included in assets/ was supplied with the project materials. If you publish this repository publicly, retain any attribution required by the image's original source/license.
